{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午10時54分，一名年約60歲男子報案，指在西貢蠔涌水口工作期間，腳部不慎被困在泥頭車的車底。消防員到場將他救出，清醒送到將軍澳醫院治理，警方列意外受傷跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"工人被救出，清醒送將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192807162762498048385619.jpeg/jalIbI1KjHX2ymobsCyRE3zOFet8vHTVQdBVnWTQVZ0\"/><figcaption>工人被救出，清醒送將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工人被送到將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192808106585755648382574.jpeg/JqGHOFUun7aOhHEoX4qby3uxcqPuw9-SVQl2n1UJdp8\"/><figcaption>工人被送到將軍澳醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西貢蠔涌村。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261030/1192812914457710592314597.jpeg/VT97Prrb8KsnMX9ZOM7JXpCXrklP8vDbiMoD_63KA_8\"/><figcaption>西貢蠔涌村。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:45.151252+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:43.461501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:43.461501+00:00","content_hash":"3619dc4b2879fb68bac55b9971a6138be2ae2aad97b0754301b94726da43b009","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}